### High-Card — User endpoints
# All endpoints below require a JWT in the Authorization header.
# 1. Run a login from auth.http and copy the response `token`.
# 2. Paste the alice token in @adminToken below, the bob token in @userToken.
# Tokens stay valid for ~60 minutes (see app.jwt.expiration-minutes).

